#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:18
msgid ""
"Warp's website feels like sitting at a campfire in a deep forest — warm, "
"dark, and alive with quiet confidence. Unlike the cold, blue-tinted "
"blacks favored by most developer tools, Warp wraps everything in a warm "
"near-black that feels like charred wood or dark earth. The text isn't "
"pure white either — it's Warm Parchment (`#faf9f6`), a barely-perceptible"
" cream that softens every headline and makes the dark canvas feel "
"inviting rather than austere."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:20
msgid ""
"The typography is the secret weapon: Matter, a geometric sans-serif with "
"distinctive character, deployed at Regular weight across virtually all "
"text. The font choice is unusual for a developer tool — Matter has a "
"softness and humanity that signals \"this terminal is for everyone, not "
"just greybeards.\" Combined with tight line-heights and controlled "
"negative letter-spacing on headlines, the effect is refined and "
"approachable simultaneously. Nature photography is woven between terminal"
" screenshots, creating a visual language that says: this tool brings you "
"closer to flow, to calm productivity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:22
msgid ""
"The overall design philosophy is restraint through warmth. Minimal color "
"(almost monochromatic warm grays), minimal ornamentation, and a focus on "
"product showcases set against cinematic dark landscapes. It's a terminal "
"company that markets like a lifestyle brand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:25
msgid ""
"Warm dark background — not cold black, but earthy near-black with warm "
"gray undertones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:26
msgid ""
"Warm Parchment (`#faf9f6`) text instead of pure white — subtle cream "
"warmth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:27
msgid ""
"Matter font family (Regular weight) — geometric but approachable, not the"
" typical developer-tool typeface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:28
msgid ""
"Nature photography interleaved with product screenshots — lifestyle meets"
" developer tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:29
msgid "Almost monochromatic warm gray palette — no bold accent colors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:30
msgid ""
"Uppercase labels with wide letter-spacing (2.4px) for categorization — "
"editorial signaling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:31
msgid "Pill-shaped dark buttons (`#353534`, 50px radius) — restrained, muted CTAs"
msgstr ""

