#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:100
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:101
msgid ""
"**Regular weight dominance**: Nearly all text uses weight 400 (Regular) —"
" even headlines. Matter Medium (500) appears only for emphasis moments "
"like card titles and buttons. This creates a remarkably even, calm "
"typographic texture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:102
msgid ""
"**Uppercase as editorial signal**: Small labels and categories use "
"uppercase transform with wide letter-spacing (1.4px–2.4px), creating a "
"magazine-editorial categorization system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:103
msgid ""
"**Warm legibility**: The combination of Matter's geometric softness + "
"warm text colors (#faf9f6) + controlled negative tracking creates text "
"that reads as effortlessly human on dark surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:104
msgid ""
"**No bold display**: Zero use of bold (700+) weight anywhere — restraint "
"is the philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:106
msgid "4. Component Stylings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:108
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:109
msgid ""
"**Dark Pill**: `#353534` background, Ash Gray (`#afaeac`) text, pill "
"shape (50px radius), `10px` padding. The primary CTA — warm, muted, "
"understated"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:110
msgid ""
"**Frosted Tag**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16)` background, black text "
"(`rgb(0, 0, 0)`), rectangular (6px radius), `1px 6px` padding. Small "
"inline tag-like buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:111
msgid ""
"**Ghost**: No visible background, text-only with underline decoration on "
"hover"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:112
msgid "**Hover**: Subtle opacity or brightness shift — no dramatic color changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:114
msgid "Cards & Containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:115
msgid ""
"**Photography Cards**: Full-bleed nature imagery with overlay text, "
"8px–12px border-radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:116
msgid ""
"**Terminal Screenshot Cards**: Product UI embedded in dark containers "
"with rounded corners (8px–12px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:117
msgid ""
"**Bordered Cards**: Semi-transparent border (`rgba(226, 226, 226, 0.35)`)"
" for containment, 12px–14px radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:118
msgid ""
"**Hover**: Minimal — content cards don't dramatically change on hover, "
"maintaining the calm aesthetic"
msgstr ""

