#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:184
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Semi-transparent borders** instead of shadows — borders at 35% opacity "
"create a ghostly containment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:185
msgid ""
"**Photography layering** — images create natural depth without artificial"
" shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:186
msgid ""
"**Surface opacity shifts** — `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)` overlays create "
"barely-perceptible layer differences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:187
msgid "The effect is calm and grounded — nothing floats, everything rests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:189
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:190
msgid ""
"**Photography as depth**: Nature images create atmospheric depth that "
"shadows cannot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:191
msgid ""
"**No glass or blur effects**: The design avoids trendy glassmorphism "
"entirely"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:192
msgid ""
"**Warm ambient**: Any glow comes from the photography's natural lighting,"
" not artificial CSS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:194
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:196
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:197
msgid ""
"Use warm off-white (`#faf9f6`) for text instead of pure white — the cream"
" undertone is essential"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:198
msgid ""
"Keep buttons restrained and muted — dark fill (#353534) with muted text "
"(#afaeac), no bright CTAs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:199
msgid ""
"Apply Matter Regular (weight 400) for nearly everything — even headlines."
" Reserve Medium (500) for emphasis only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:200
msgid ""
"Use uppercase labels with wide letter-spacing (1.4px–2.4px) for "
"categorization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:201
msgid ""
"Interleave nature photography with product screenshots — this is core to "
"the brand identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:202
msgid ""
"Maintain the almost monochromatic warm gray palette — no bold accent "
"colors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:203
msgid ""
"Use semi-transparent borders (`rgba(226, 226, 226, 0.35)`) for card "
"containment instead of shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:204
msgid ""
"Keep negative letter-spacing on headlines (-0.4px to -2.4px) for Matter's"
" compressed display treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:206
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:207
msgid "Use pure white (#ffffff) for text — it's always warm parchment (#faf9f6)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:208
msgid ""
"Add bold accent colors (blue, red, green) — the system is deliberately "
"monochromatic warm grays"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:209
msgid "Apply bold weight (700+) to any text — Warp never goes above Medium (500)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:210
msgid ""
"Use heavy drop shadows — depth comes from borders, photography, and "
"opacity shifts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:211
msgid "Create cold or blue-tinted dark backgrounds — the warmth is essential"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:212
msgid ""
"Add decorative gradients or glow effects — the photography provides all "
"visual interest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:213
msgid ""
"Use tight, compressed layouts — the editorial spacing is generous and "
"contemplative"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_warp.md:214
msgid "Mix in additional typefaces beyond the Matter family + Inter supplement"
msgstr ""

